                  MOVE ' LINK ZQU00K0Q FAILED' TO EM-VARIABLE
                  PERFORM WRITE-ERROR-MESSAGE
               END-IF.
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*
       CALL-ZQU003M8-003.
               EXEC CICS XCTL PROGRAM('ZQU003M8')
                         COMMAREA(DFHCOMMAREA)
                         LENGTH(WS-CALEN)
               END-EXEC.
               IF WS-RESP NOT = DFHRESP(NORMAL)
                  MOVE ' LINK ZQU003M8 FAILED' TO EM-VARIABLE
                  PERFORM WRITE-ERROR-MESSAGE
